WEBVTT

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:07.940
On the banquet that is being held on the twenty-second of this month,

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:12.990
there are more than one hundred guests being invited from all around the country.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:18.240
We are expected to get as many guests from the Empire as we will from the Federation.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:22.040
Gallia may be at war with the Empire,

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:27.500
but it would not be wise to approach and befriend the Federation lightly.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:36.800
The protection of the rights and obligations of us nobility is of utmost priority which surpasses the idea of borders.

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:39.640
Princess Cordelia.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.600
Princess Cordelia!

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:43.180
Yes.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.730
This is not good.

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:50.270
Borg's time by your side as Regent cannot last forever.

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:53.820
In this state, you will not make a good princess.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.660
I'm sorry.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:01:07.580
All the strict words that I give you is for the time when you become enthroned as the supreme ruler of Gallia.

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:09.090
I understand.

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:17.220
Then, princess. At tonight's banquet, you will take part in the awarding of medals.

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:24.040
Chapter 11

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:24.040
Uninvited Guests

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:23.580
Like that and...

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.160
There.

00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:33.340
Ready yet, Welkin?

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:35.970
Isara is waiting outside as well.

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:37.550
Just a little more.

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:39.890
I cannot get this necktie tied right.

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:41.100
Necktie?

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:50.650
Alicia, that look...

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:56.900
You were going to say I look like a goldfish, right?

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:01.160
No, not goldfish, but more like an oily mackerel.

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:05.870
Well, this doesn't make a compliment, does it?

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:11.790
Well, I understand because it's me, but you shouldn't say that to other girls, okay?

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:14.130
Hold still.

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:19.720
Really, you can't do things that people can and can do things that they can't.

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:20.840
Is that so?

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:21.930
Yes, it is.

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:23.260
However...

00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:27.180
that is how you got invited to the castle.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:30.140
I wish that everyone could have come.

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:31.940
Let's buy something for them on the way back.

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:32.670
Yeah.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.080
What would be good?

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:48.660
Ah. You don't have to think about that, Welkin.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.460
Isara and I will do the selecting.

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:52.580
Instead, you can carry the load.

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:54.960
Eh? That's mean.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:56.460
Whoa.

00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:58.550
Faldio?

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:00.090
Well, excuse me.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:03.930
Tying Welkin's necktie used to be my job.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.430
What are you saying?!

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:07.060
Come on, Faldio.

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:09.270
I didn't think that you would make it.

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:10.980
Is the injury on your leg better?

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:11.980
Yeah.

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:14.650
It's a banquet sponsored by Princess Cordelia.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:19.570
Being invited to such an event would wake up even the dead.

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:22.360
I'm not going to let you take all the good parts.

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:23.340
Eh?

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:26.030
I have Ramal waiting for us downstairs.

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:26.990
Let's go.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:38.000
On the surface, it seems like the decision was made on the good record of the Battle of Kloden.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:43.470
However, the aim behind this is probably to raise popularity of the Randgriz family and boost national pride.

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:45.300
Be careful, Welkin.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:47.180
Huh? Why?

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:51.930
You are General Gunther's son. There will be those who will try to use you.

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:56.770
That won't happen. Most of all, I cannot be like my father.

00:03:56.770 --> 00:04:00.320
It's not "cannot", but "will not" for you, Welkin.

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.530
Right?

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:06.950
If he won't, then there is always forcibly making him that way.

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:09.490
Enough with the disdaining thoughts, now.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:10.790
Right, Isara?

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:11.950
Ramal?

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:14.290
Eh? Ah, yes.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:16.630
Hey, hey. Were you enchanted by Isara's charm?

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.960
That's not what it was!

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:33.060
What should I do? I'm starting to feel nervous.

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:37.060
Nervous? I would have never expected that from Alicia.

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:39.400
Hey, Welkin.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:42.570
Don't you think Faldio is a little spiteful today?

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:43.320
Huh?

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:45.070
Do you think so?

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:46.570
Haha, so you realized?

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:49.830
Today's Alicia is quite beautiful, and so.

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:50.740
That again?

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:53.040
I'm saying that that's the spiteful part.

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:05.380
I don't think that this war will last long.

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:07.260
Awesome!

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:10.890
You could create a continental Social Register in just a day here.

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:14.100
Ambassador Townsend.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:15.850
Allow me to ask you some questions.

00:05:15.850 --> 00:05:18.770
Irene Ellet from Radio GBS, sir.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:24.860
What do you, as the ambassador of the Federation, think of the future relationships between the Federation and Gallia?

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:29.320
I believe that it is not a topic that can be lightly talked about in this kind of place.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:33.950
I am sorry, sir, but I believe that is what the people are most interested about.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:34.950
And thus?

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:39.290
Given this opportunity, are there any plans to make a separate meeting with the Empire?

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:42.880
That definitely is something that I cannot talk about in this kind of place.

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:43.780
Excuse us.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.930
He's as obdurate as the rumors say.

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:54.310
He may be capable, but his way of dealing with reporters doesn't feel right at all.

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:57.810
This side looks like more of a scoop.

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:04.190
Could I hear your feelings about recieving the award, Lieutenant Welkin Gunther?

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:04.900
Huh?

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.070
Miss Ellet.

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:07.780
Could you give me a word or two?

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:09.410
W-Well...

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.070
Thank you.

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:13.740
Come on. Isn't there anything else you can say?

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:15.490
It was too sudden, you know.

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:18.040
Besides, I haven't received it yet.

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:21.080
Well, will you tell me about it afterwards?

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:23.980
That should be fine.

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:28.590
It's just my instinct, but I think there's going to be something.

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:29.930
Something?

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:32.340
Yes. A reporter's instinct.

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:34.680
There's that "Who knows?" feeling.

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:44.650
Well, darn me.

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:49.570
At this rate, wouldn't the banquet end even before we get to the castle?

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:54.450
For a man who is the Count of Alsse to use such words...

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:58.250
Well, forgive me, Countess of Alsse.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:05.880
Come now. You and I are playing husband and wife, you know.

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:08.170
It isn't good if you have forgotten about it.

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:10.010
I have not forgotten it.

00:07:10.010 --> 00:07:11.880
I just thought that this smells of monkey business.

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:13.260
What are you saying?

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:17.260
You aren't thinking that this is just a banquet of enjoyment, right?

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:21.350
Getting in touch with the Federation while looking good to the Empire...

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:24.560
Gallia is trying hard to play both sides.

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:29.530
Even so, it would still be fine without generals themselves acting as spies.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:33.070
Sorry, infiltration is my hobby.

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:39.620
To be honest, having to accompany you to such a thing is nothing more than a nuisance.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:42.500
If it wasn't for his majesty's order, something like this...

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:48.500
Well, that's because I am more able at handling Maximilian than you are.

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:54.640
I didn't think you would be the type to show things on your face.

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:04.440
Well, then. Shall we go, Countess?

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:18.030
My, what a beautiful couple.

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:19.790
I wonder who they are.

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:22.390
Do you know, darling?

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:23.160
Well...

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:26.830
This is where the monkey business starts.

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:32.590
Right, right. That's the way to go.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:43.600
What's wrong?

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:44.480
It's nothing.

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:58.490
Why?

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:00.370
Alicia.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:01.830
Are you not well?

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:03.000
Did you get people-sick?

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:06.370
Selvaria...

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.500
Selvaria is here.

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:22.970
I see. At Barious?

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:26.270
We were sure that we finished them off with Batomys.

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:33.900
Interesting. We have more actors on stage than I expected.

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:40.570
The connection between the Federation and Gallia will become important in coming times.

00:09:40.570 --> 00:09:46.960
As for the Federation, we are willing to strengthen the trusting relationship with Gallia even further.

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:49.290
You are a great man, Ambassador Townsend.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:52.540
You carry wisdom and a distinguishing rationality.

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:55.690
Yes.

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:59.890
Princess Cordelia feels strongly so as well.

00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:01.760
It is an honor.

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:07.310
They obviously would have forged their identity, but it is still quite bold of them.

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:09.140
I wonder who the one with her is.

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:10.350
It bothers me.

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:12.940
What would be their aim?

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:15.780
There's no doubt that they are up to something.

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:20.780
Out of all days, why did we run into her here and now?

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:24.950
It's Princess Cordelia.

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.340
Princess Cordelia.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:56.650
Her Majesty, Gallia's Princess Cordelia gi Randgriz, enters!

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:23.640
To be able to invite so many guests from the Federation and be together at this banquet

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:26.970
fills me with endless joy.

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:33.850
It may be short, but I want you all to enjoy this time.

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:40.340
Ambassador Townsend, please.

00:12:03.630 --> 00:12:04.840
Could it be?

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:14.980
Tonight, being able to be in the presence of Princess Cordelia, the heir to the Randgriz family and of Valkyrian descent,

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:18.440
fills me with unexpressible joy.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:24.450
Then, in celebration of prosperity of Gallia, cheers.

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:26.070
Cheers!

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:33.210
There's nothing touchy there.

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:38.670
Shouldn't he be embarrassed as an ambassador for giving that kind of speech?

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:50.620
To continue, I would like to introduce to you the brave and excelling militias.

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:55.940
Lieutenant Welkin Gunther and Lieutenant Faldio Landzaat.

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:05.450
The recapture of Vasel Bridge and the victory at Kloden Forest was achieved by these two men.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:10.330
Well, well. To meet the one who has captured Gregor's heart here.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.160
Eh?

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:12.740
Just my story.

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:18.880
In accordance with these records, they will be awarded by Princess Cordelia with the Principality Medal of Honor.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:27.360
Lieutenant Welkin Gunther is the son of the late General Gunther, who showed outstanding service in the previous war.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:32.470
As long as there are young men such as them, Gallia shall stand firm.

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:35.980
He doesn't have to introduce him that way.

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:38.650
Welkin is used to it, so...

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:41.520
Just because he is doesn't mean that it's okay.

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:42.610
Right?

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:45.030
Thanks.

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.710
I'm going to get some fresh air.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:05.110
Okay.

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:17.640
Welkin and Faldio are both of the well-tailored class.

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:20.630
Well, well, my fair lady.

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:23.570
We have met before.

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:29.090
At Kloden, you were very brave and beautiful

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:33.030
like the legendary Valkyrians.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.910
But tonight is a banquet.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.710
Let's not try anything rough.

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:46.710
Excuse me. I have some business to attend to.

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:53.760
It isn't a business.

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:56.470
I'm sorry. I just can't stick around those kinds of places.

00:14:56.470 --> 00:15:03.340
I know. I also know that you came to receive the prize that you didn't want for the sake of Ms. Varrot and the militia.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:06.530
You saw right through me, as usual.

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:08.990
How many years have we been together?

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:12.800
But even so, there is something I do not get.

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:15.080
What did you do?

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:17.490
I read in the report.

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:21.040
You seemed to have spent a night with Alicia.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:22.540
What was it like?

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.090
Thankfully, nothing happened.

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.290
...is not the right answer!

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:28.170
Did you at least hold hands together?

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:30.720
Hand? Why hand?

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:32.800
Listen up, Welkin.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:34.510
Knock it off, already.

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:37.720
Alicia is cute, and you are a guy.

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:39.270
What more is there to it?

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:41.100
Wait, Faldio.

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:46.110
Are you expecting Alicia and I to go into a relationship as individuals of opposite sex?

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:53.490
It seems like your head has no brain but is only filled with lizards and beetles.

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:56.740
Why are you like that?

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:58.620
Don't you think she is cute?

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:02.710
Alicia is...

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.380
What plans do you have?

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:11.840
Plans?

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:17.390
Wanting to be closer with a beautiful lady is natural for a male.

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:19.010
No, not that!

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:20.810
What reason are you here for?

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:22.560
Oh, right.

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:28.520
If you glare like so, I have no choice but to answer.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:34.070
A word of advice: if you don't want to get yourself in trouble, you should return soon.

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:36.870
Relay this to the young ones.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:51.210
The jokes end there, General Jaeger.

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:54.340
Here comes the pest.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:59.220
Wait!

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:03.810
I'm sorry!

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:04.600
Alicia?

00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:06.440
Welkin!

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:07.230
Faldio!

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:08.650
It's serious! Listen!

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:09.190
What is it?

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:10.980
Calm down. What's wrong?

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:12.980
Just now, the two from the Empire was...

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.490
This should put Gallia on solid ground.

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:20.490
He is the great Borg.

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:21.910
Much gratitude.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:26.120
Are you not feeling tired?

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:30.460
Princess Cordelia will be exiting now.

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:42.100
Jaeger... Jaeger of the Triumvirate?!

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:43.850
The enemy's general?

00:17:43.850 --> 00:17:45.680
But what is going on?

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:48.810
Aren't they the one who are trying to do something?

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:49.900
I don't know.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:52.440
Anyhow, I'll go get Isara and the others.

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:01.120
What's wrong?

00:18:02.030 --> 00:18:06.160
Jaeger greeted me and...

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:07.080
That's it?

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.420
It's not that!

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:10.670
This was the first time this has happened to me.

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:12.790
Eww, it's sick!

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:17.380
To poor Alicia,

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:19.050
let me give you this.

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:26.100
While I was resting on injury, I returned to Barious to pick it up.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:28.690
What? You have to rest properly!

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.150
I concur.

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:34.520
But I'm happy.

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:36.070
I'll treasure it.

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:40.490
What is it?

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:41.700
It's nothing.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:45.580
I wonder if Welkin isn't done yet.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:47.080
I'll go as well.

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:48.830
That way is...

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:57.420
A court lady will be here shortly to assist you with your return.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:58.170
Understood.

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:02.140
I need to return to the banquet.

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:26.480
I'm tired.

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:33.030
Huh?

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:36.340
Where is this?

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:46.620
Who is it?!

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:54.680
Nothing else can be done.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.480
Take them away.

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:12.860
Good day, everyone.

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:20.980
I am Cordelia gi Randgriz, Princess of Gallia, known as a descendent of the Valkyrians.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:27.990
Protecting the traditions and culture of this nation and passing them down to the generations after is my duty.

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:34.510
Next on Valkyria Chronicles: Chapter Twelve - Kidnapped Princess.

